# Tuent Core — tra API trước khi viết mới

Nguồn: `Assets/TuentCore/Runtime/`.

| Cần | Type | Namespace |
|---|---|---|
| Log | `TLogger` | `Tuent.Core` |
| Singleton Mono | `MonoSingleton<T>` | `Tuent.Core` |
| Singleton C#/SO | `Singleton<T>`, `ScriptableObjectSingleton<T>`, `ResourcesSingleton` | `Tuent.Core` |
| Event type-safe | `Signal`, `BaseSignal`, `IBaseSignal` | `Tuent.Core` |
| Pool | `TPool`, `TPoolers`, `IPoolable` | `Tuent.Core` |
| Save | `BaseDataSave<T>`, `LocalStorageUtils`, `JsonHelper` | `Tuent.Core` |
| Audio | `AudioManager`, `AudioDatabase`, `AudioIdentity` | `Tuent.Core` |
| Addressables | `ComponentReference<T>`, `DataReference`, `AddressableDataHolder` | `Tuent.Core` |
| UI | `UIScreen`, `UIPopup`, `ScreenData`, `PopupData` | `Tuent.Core.UI` |
| Helper | `ObjectFinder`, `Loading`, `Toast` | `Tuent.Core.UI` |

```csharp
using Tuent.Core;

TLogger.Log("Gameplay", $"Wave {index}");
var go = TPool.Spawn(prefab, parent);
```

Code game mới → `Assets/_MainProject/Scripts/`, namespace riêng (không `Tuent.Core*`).
